      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devine quoi ? J’ai encore besoin de ton aide\npour créer une fragrance exceptionnelle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette fois, l’inspiration me vient... de l’encre\nnoire d’un Sepiatop !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est là que tu entres en scène !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C00E0002000710075006500200074007500200065006E007400720065007300200065006E00200073006300E8006E00650020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais que tu m’amènes un Sepiatop !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069006D0065007200610069007300200071007500650020007400750020006D20190061006D00E8006E0065007300200075006E0020005300650070006900610074006F00700020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peux-tu mettre un Sepiatop dans ton équipe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750078002D007400750020006D0065007400740072006500200075006E0020005300650070006900610074006F0070002000640061006E007300200074006F006E002000E9007100750069007000650020003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu m’as amené un Sepiatop ! Merci !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006D20190061007300200061006D0065006E00E900200075006E0020005300650070006900610074006F0070002000210020004D00650072006300690020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors... juste un petit peu d’encre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002E002E002E0020006A007500730074006500200075006E00200070006500740069007400200070006500750020006420190065006E006300720065002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors ! Elle est d’un noir encore plus profond\nque je me l’imaginais...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez ! Il faut que je prépare le parfum tant que\nl’ingrédient est frais !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà ! Tu as devant les yeux ma dernière\ncréation : « Encroyable », de Romy !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce parfum mystérieux n’est pas sans rappeler\nla douceur d’une brise marine... Renversant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais il reste un problème, quand même.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200069006C00200072006500730074006500200075006E002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D0065002C0020007100750061006E00640020006D00EA006D0065002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça sent bon, mais ça donne faim !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C70061002000730065006E007400200062006F006E002C0020006D006100690073002000E7006100200064006F006E006E00650020006600610069006D0020002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certains pourront y trouver une utilisation,\nmais ça sera difficile à mettre sur le marché...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est dommage, parce que même si c’est\nun parfum unique...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200064006F006D006D006100670065002C00200070006100720063006500200071007500650020006D00EA006D0065002000730069002000632019006500730074000A0075006E002000700061007200660075006D00200075006E0069007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
